# Theory (Researcher namespace)

LaTeX theory/formal-methods documents. Each theory artifact is its own
self-contained LaTeX project in `docs/theory/<content-slug>/main.tex` (e.g.
`docs/theory/problem_statement_novelty/`) — never bare files directly under
`docs/theory/`. Build with `latexmk -pdf`, run from the artifact's own
subdirectory; reach the shared bibliography via
`\bibliography{../../references/references}`. The generated PDF is tracked
via git LFS, latest version only per artifact — see
`.friday/active/harness/rules/version_control.md`'s `lfs_policy` section. See
`.friday/active/harness/roles/researcher.md` for the full requirements.
